        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define each year's investment and return\n    investments = [500, 600, 1000]\n    returns = [0.12, 0.05, 0.01]\n\n    # Calculate total return relative to total invested\n    total_gain = sum(investment * rate for investment, rate in zip(investments, returns))\n    total_investment = sum(investments)\n    holding_period_return = total_gain / total_investment * 100\n\n    # Return the answer to three decimal places\n    return round(holding_period_return, 3)\n```",
